WEBVTT

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:19.458
You have done well to make it this far.

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:22.958
I have nothing more to teach you.

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.292
"2 months earlier..."

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:31.292
I'm going to have you transfer to a new school.

00:00:31.292 --> 00:00:35.125
You shall bide your time there...

00:00:35.125 --> 00:00:39.083
...until the time comes for you
to put your skills to use.

00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:40.583
Where am I going?

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:44.167
To Magami High School.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:09.000
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:14.000
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:21.417
<i>We exchanged promises...</i>

00:01:21.417 --> 00:01:24.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:28.958
<i>...under the moonlight</i>

00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:33.792
<i>At midnight, whispering like a roar</i>

00:01:33.792 --> 00:01:39.250
<i>In the silence and bustle of your current situation</i>

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:44.375
<i>Do you feel like you're gonna go crazy and break?</i>

00:01:44.375 --> 00:01:48.292
<i>But live your own way, yeah, like you are</i>

00:01:48.292 --> 00:01:52.208
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:57.417
<i>Let's not be chameleons</i>

00:01:57.417 --> 00:02:02.542
<i>But change ourselves from the inside</i>

00:02:02.542 --> 00:02:06.250
<i>I can hear those words</i>

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:12.833
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will break all nights</i>

00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:16.542
<i>Gently and furiously</i>

00:02:16.542 --> 00:02:28.125
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will rip apart all nights</i>

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:50.292
I don't know what hole you wandered out of...

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.458
...but this is not your world.

00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:03.375
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:04.625
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Second Night"

00:03:05.292 --> 00:03:06.625
"Encounter with Lamentation
Beneath the Cherry Blossoms"

00:03:10.917 --> 00:03:13.333
"Spring..."

00:03:29.125 --> 00:03:31.250
Good morning, Misato!

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.083
Morning!

00:03:32.083 --> 00:03:33.458
Morning, Misato.

00:03:33.458 --> 00:03:35.292
Morning!

00:03:35.292 --> 00:03:36.833
Aoi!

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:43.917
Morning, Komaki! Is your
morning practice over already?

00:03:43.917 --> 00:03:46.083
Well, ya see I came to school
without eating any breakfast,

00:03:46.083 --> 00:03:49.625
so I figured I'd use my authority
as captain and end practice early!

00:03:51.458 --> 00:03:51.958
"Magami Academy"

00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:56.500
"Oh, good morning, Milady." Yeah, whatever...

00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:02.417
They never learn, do they?

00:04:02.417 --> 00:04:06.625
You'd be hard-pressed to reply
to a stack of love letters like this.

00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:08.458
K-Komaki!

00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:10.375
That reminds me.

00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:12.792
We had that transfer student
coming in today, right?

00:04:12.792 --> 00:04:13.875
Oh...

00:04:17.792 --> 00:04:19.833
Yeah!

00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:24.958
Must be tough transferring schools
right at the end of senior year, huh?

00:04:24.958 --> 00:04:27.958
Ya think it'll be a guy or a girl?

00:04:27.958 --> 00:04:31.542
Dunno, I haven't heard anything yet.

00:04:32.542 --> 00:04:34.583
"Magami Academy"

00:04:42.458 --> 00:04:43.708
I'm heading out!

00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:44.958
See ya.

00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:33.125
Seriously?

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:34.417
Yeah! Seriously!

00:05:34.417 --> 00:05:36.792
They say he's totally hot! What'll I do?

00:05:36.792 --> 00:05:38.083
What, it's a guy?

00:05:38.083 --> 00:05:40.542
They say he's coming from
Asuka Academy. Do you know about him?

00:05:40.542 --> 00:05:41.375
Couldn't care less.

00:05:41.375 --> 00:05:44.375
Should I get hopeful about this guy?

00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:00.750
--Look at him!
--Good morning!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.375
--He’s super cute!
--And...

00:06:02.375 --> 00:06:06.125
...be quiet!

00:06:06.125 --> 00:06:10.458
Well now, I realize it's just about
the end of your high school careers,

00:06:10.458 --> 00:06:13.875
but I nevertheless have a transfer
student to introduce to all of you.

00:06:13.875 --> 00:06:17.750
He'll be joining you in
your studies starting today.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.417
Hey, you!

00:06:19.417 --> 00:06:20.458
Houraiji?

00:06:20.458 --> 00:06:23.958
Maria, baby, I got a stomach
ache, so I'm headin' home.

00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:26.000
Listen, you!

00:06:42.583 --> 00:06:45.042
A fight? What's going on?

00:06:45.042 --> 00:06:46.292
Misato!

00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:50.875
Good grief!

00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:53.833
Tanonaka...

00:06:53.833 --> 00:06:54.958
Here.

00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:55.792
Chiyama...

00:06:55.792 --> 00:06:57.042
Here.

00:06:57.042 --> 00:06:57.792
Tsunoda...

00:06:57.792 --> 00:06:59.042
Yup.

00:06:59.042 --> 00:06:59.375
Tezuka...

00:06:59.375 --> 00:07:01.292
--Something's going down!
--Here.

00:07:01.292 --> 00:07:02.667
Ono...

00:07:03.625 --> 00:07:05.125
Ono?

00:07:06.458 --> 00:07:07.958
Absent...

00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:14.208
Done running?

00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:18.625
We won't trouble anyone else here.

00:07:21.208 --> 00:07:23.292
I don't like you at all.

00:07:30.083 --> 00:07:31.458
Sakurai?

00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:32.458
You're going too?

00:07:32.458 --> 00:07:34.083
Yes...

00:07:34.083 --> 00:07:35.792
I've got a bad feeling.

00:07:57.292 --> 00:07:59.417
Kyouichi Houraiji...

00:08:02.625 --> 00:08:04.292
Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:08:07.458 --> 00:08:09.583
Wh-What was that all about?

00:08:14.208 --> 00:08:16.292
There's my scoop!

00:08:24.875 --> 00:08:26.417
Good work.

00:08:26.417 --> 00:08:27.792
It was nothing.

00:08:30.542 --> 00:08:33.458
Changing the wallpaper, huh?

00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:38.958
Well, I guess it's not much to look at,

00:08:38.958 --> 00:08:43.125
but sometimes it's the greasy
spoons that serve up the best food.

00:08:43.125 --> 00:08:44.875
In this town, at least.

00:08:53.708 --> 00:08:56.625
What, she your type or somethin'?

00:08:57.625 --> 00:08:59.125
That girl...

00:09:17.417 --> 00:09:19.292
Well? Good, isn't it?

00:09:19.292 --> 00:09:20.375
Yeah...

00:09:21.917 --> 00:09:23.583
What's wrong?

00:09:24.625 --> 00:09:28.083
Nothing. Nice music, huh?

00:09:28.083 --> 00:09:29.250
Huh?

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.583
Can't say I know much about that kinda stuff.

00:09:38.833 --> 00:09:39.083
"Morning Melee The Delinquent
vs. the Narcoleptic Transfer Student"

00:09:39.083 --> 00:09:41.917
Damn! Writing whatever she damn well pleases!

00:09:41.917 --> 00:09:43.375
That dirty son of a bitch...

00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:46.083
Oh, I guess she can't be
a son of a bitch if she's a girl, huh?

00:09:46.083 --> 00:09:50.583
Ah, whatever! That son of a bitch,
she's gonna pay the piper for this!

00:09:57.417 --> 00:09:58.625
Hiyu?

00:09:59.958 --> 00:10:03.375
Oh, you're the class president, um...

00:10:03.375 --> 00:10:04.708
Aoi Misato.

00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:06.208
That's right, Misato.

00:10:06.208 --> 00:10:09.250
What do you want, Milady?

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:12.500
Ms. Alucard asked me to show
you the ropes around campus,

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:16.042
and I was also wondering if you
might be having trouble with anything.

00:10:16.042 --> 00:10:18.375
Oh, how very <i>kind </i>of you!

00:10:18.375 --> 00:10:19.167
Why you...

00:10:19.167 --> 00:10:21.542
Komaki!

00:10:21.542 --> 00:10:24.458
Thank you, but I'm fine for now actually.

00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:27.667
I see. Okay, then...

00:10:28.792 --> 00:10:30.042
Oh, one other thing.

00:10:30.042 --> 00:10:31.958
Aoi!

00:10:31.958 --> 00:10:34.625
There have been a lot of awful
things happening around here lately,

00:10:34.625 --> 00:10:37.417
so Ms. Alucard said to be careful.

00:10:37.417 --> 00:10:38.500
Awful things?

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:41.875
Yes, students have been going missing,

00:10:41.875 --> 00:10:44.333
and there have been some murders.

00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:48.917
You can see the number of victims is going
up and up just by watching the news reports.

00:10:48.917 --> 00:10:52.583
So many people have been dying every day...

00:10:52.583 --> 00:10:54.958
You going to be okay?

00:10:54.958 --> 00:10:57.792
It's really unusual, isn't it?

00:10:57.792 --> 00:10:59.708
Why? How?

00:10:59.708 --> 00:11:00.708
Cripes...

00:11:00.708 --> 00:11:03.042
Then why don't you try
<i>doing </i>something about it?

00:11:03.042 --> 00:11:05.125
Your family's loaded, right?

00:11:05.125 --> 00:11:09.167
So, see if you can buy a solution to this, Milady.

00:11:09.167 --> 00:11:13.458
Under the skin, people are no
different than animals anyway.

00:11:13.458 --> 00:11:15.750
Ain't anything "unusual" about it.

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:20.000
They kill, they devour, they rape.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:20.917
Why you!

00:11:20.917 --> 00:11:27.208
Nothing a little lady who lives in
a great big mansion would know about though.

00:11:27.208 --> 00:11:28.750
Aoi!

00:11:32.625 --> 00:11:34.917
What?

00:11:34.917 --> 00:11:36.417
Nothing.

00:11:40.125 --> 00:11:45.125
Calling Mr. Inugami, Mr. Inugami:
Please report to the staff room.

00:11:45.125 --> 00:11:47.750
How the hell long are you
going to keep us waiting?!

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.833
Get over here on the double!

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.875
And in other news,

00:11:52.875 --> 00:11:56.375
it has been determined that a certain
work of art which was under transport

00:11:56.375 --> 00:11:58.417
was carried off yesterday in
the aftermath of an explosion

00:11:58.417 --> 00:12:01.167
that occurred in the early morning
on the Tokyo-Nagoya Expressway.

00:12:01.167 --> 00:12:02.375
It is believed the work in question

00:12:02.375 --> 00:12:04.375
is one of what are known
as the "ten sacred treasures."

00:12:04.375 --> 00:12:06.500
Some believe the accident itself

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:10.542
may have been a smokescreen
to facilitate the theft of the item.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:28.458
Damn, the transfer student's getting
all the ladies! Makes me jealous.

00:12:28.458 --> 00:12:30.917
Here, lemme read...

00:12:31.167 --> 00:12:32.667
"I like you! Maybe?"

00:12:32.667 --> 00:12:36.292
Uh, what's up with that?

00:12:36.292 --> 00:12:39.083
Hey, you up for some ramen? My treat.

00:12:41.042 --> 00:12:44.667
The item the master requested has arrived.

00:12:47.625 --> 00:12:49.208
My Lady?

00:12:49.208 --> 00:12:51.500
Oh, I see. Thank you.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.917
I honestly don't know
what I'll do with my father.

00:12:53.917 --> 00:12:58.667
Always buying things even
though he hardly ever comes home...

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.292
"Blunt: That's sick, you freak!"

00:13:15.292 --> 00:13:17.500
"Dream: I'll kill you first!"

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:19.458
"Chaos: I know how you feel. Kill 'em.
Juvenile law says we're..."

00:13:24.167 --> 00:13:26.375
Hey, Boss...

00:13:26.375 --> 00:13:28.250
Huh?

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:31.458
Well, if it isn't old man Yang!

00:13:31.458 --> 00:13:33.458
I sure appreciate the help the other day.

00:13:33.458 --> 00:13:35.375
You're not making trouble again, are you?

00:13:35.375 --> 00:13:38.292
Aw, c'mon, have some faith!

00:13:38.292 --> 00:13:40.042
Well, see ya.

00:13:40.042 --> 00:13:42.625
Later! Take care now, Boss.

00:13:42.625 --> 00:13:44.542
I cleaned up, Master!

00:13:44.542 --> 00:13:45.542
All right...

00:13:45.542 --> 00:13:50.375
What'd ya think would
happen if the Boss saw this?

00:13:50.375 --> 00:13:51.875
No kidding...

00:13:51.875 --> 00:13:54.417
He'd beat the living daylights out of us,

00:13:54.417 --> 00:13:59.083
then we'd wander in Limbo because
we couldn't get into Heaven.

00:13:59.083 --> 00:14:00.292
That'd be the worst...

00:14:00.292 --> 00:14:04.000
I'd like to die in peace, at least.

00:14:06.667 --> 00:14:08.125
Whassup?

00:14:08.125 --> 00:14:10.750
Hey, Kyochee! C'mon in!

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:11.917
Don't call me that!

00:14:11.917 --> 00:14:13.792
Just have somethin' to eat, will ya?

00:14:16.667 --> 00:14:18.750
Tatsuma Hiyu...

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.417
Huh? What are you doin' here?

00:14:23.625 --> 00:14:24.625
A showdown?

00:14:24.625 --> 00:14:29.292
A guy from the Wrestling Club was telling me
that Daigo's going to fight the transfer student.

00:14:29.292 --> 00:14:30.625
Wh-Where?

00:14:30.625 --> 00:14:32.042
At the old school building.

00:14:32.042 --> 00:14:34.042
Guys are so stupid, aren't they?

00:14:34.042 --> 00:14:37.667
I mean, what exactly is this
going to prove? Hello? Aoi?

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:41.792
This old school building's
been around since before the War,

00:14:41.792 --> 00:14:43.917
but now it's been condemned.

00:14:43.917 --> 00:14:46.792
In other words, no one's
going to get in our way?

00:14:46.792 --> 00:14:48.208
Why'd you have to come along?

00:14:48.208 --> 00:14:52.500
Well, you need a referee, don't you?

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:54.625
So, why's it so bright in here anyway?

00:14:54.625 --> 00:14:58.167
I got the lights from the Theater Club
in exchange for twenty boxed lunches.

00:14:58.167 --> 00:14:59.708
That's not what I'm asking.

00:14:59.708 --> 00:15:01.833
What does it matter?

00:15:03.167 --> 00:15:08.167
And with all the talismans you've plastered
all over the place like a bunch of escort ads,

00:15:08.167 --> 00:15:09.917
it makes me wonder if we
should expect to see some spooks.

00:15:09.917 --> 00:15:11.250
We won't!

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:14.167
We're not going to see any kind of spooks!
If I say we won't, we won't!

00:15:16.083 --> 00:15:18.458
Anyway, let's do this!

00:15:18.458 --> 00:15:20.375
Aoi!

00:15:23.208 --> 00:15:25.625
C'mon, c'mon!

00:15:25.625 --> 00:15:28.583
What's the matter?
Come get some, Tatsuma Hiyu!

00:15:28.583 --> 00:15:30.417
C'mon! C'mon!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:46.250
Looks like this could get interesting.

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.125
Stop it, you guys!

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:49.917
Aoi!

00:15:51.625 --> 00:15:53.125
S-Sakurai!

00:15:53.125 --> 00:15:54.250
Misato?

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.625
Sheesh, the little lady's pretty damn nosey.

00:15:56.625 --> 00:15:58.917
I'm sorry, but you can't do this!

00:15:58.917 --> 00:16:01.625
You need to have a teacher's
permission to do this sort of thing!

00:16:01.625 --> 00:16:03.667
Oh, <i>that's </i>what you're worried about, huh?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.833
In any case, we need to get out of here.

00:16:07.833 --> 00:16:09.333
I'll help you clean up.

00:16:09.333 --> 00:16:11.125
Wait! Don't come in here!

00:16:21.083 --> 00:16:22.083
This is...

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.042
A-Aoi!

00:16:30.833 --> 00:16:31.958
The talismans!

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:38.083
It... It's all right, Sakurai! I'm here for you!

00:16:42.792 --> 00:16:44.000
What the...

00:17:02.458 --> 00:17:04.500
Wh-What's going on?!

00:17:20.125 --> 00:17:21.583
Wait!

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.833
Good morning, Misato!

00:18:09.833 --> 00:18:10.750
Morning!

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:12.042
Morning, Misato.

00:18:12.042 --> 00:18:13.875
Morning!

00:18:13.875 --> 00:18:15.458
Aoi!

00:18:31.208 --> 00:18:32.583
Who are you?

00:18:43.583 --> 00:18:44.458
What is this?

00:18:44.458 --> 00:18:45.958
Hey, snapped out of it?

00:18:45.958 --> 00:18:47.083
Kyouichi!

00:18:47.083 --> 00:18:50.417
I dunno what's going on here,
but it looks like we're in a lot of trouble.

00:18:50.417 --> 00:18:51.958
Misato!

00:18:53.542 --> 00:18:54.875
Komaki!

00:18:56.542 --> 00:18:57.958
Aoi...

00:19:48.208 --> 00:19:49.583
Tatsuma!

00:20:15.667 --> 00:20:16.917
Kyouichi!

00:20:28.792 --> 00:20:29.958
Hiyu!

00:20:42.917 --> 00:20:44.750
--I hit her!
--Yeah, but...

00:20:50.292 --> 00:20:51.500
Komaki!

00:21:03.833 --> 00:21:05.708
My Lady, what on Earth is the meaning of this?

00:21:05.708 --> 00:21:07.375
Kisaragi!

00:21:09.958 --> 00:21:12.292
It undid the seals on its own?

00:21:12.292 --> 00:21:16.083
No, that sensation I had earlier...

00:21:16.083 --> 00:21:20.125
It couldn't be! Did <i>they </i>summon it?!

00:21:27.583 --> 00:21:31.458
Tenma gedo kaibusho shima sansho chodorai...

00:21:37.042 --> 00:21:41.542
Makai bukkai dojori, isso byodo mushabetsu...

00:21:41.542 --> 00:21:42.542
Ran!

00:21:55.875 --> 00:21:59.167
Is it... Is it over?

00:22:12.625 --> 00:22:15.083
I want you to tell me something.

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:17.125
What's going on?

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:31.958
Good grief, looks like trouble's brewing.

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:47.417
<i>I sadly hung my head a bit</i>

00:22:47.417 --> 00:22:52.500
<i>And finally you murmured</i>

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:56.750
<i>What I heard was a faint goodbye</i>

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:01.667
<i>Said with all your might</i>

00:23:03.625 --> 00:23:12.958
<i>Our pulses echo in the awkward silence</i>

00:23:12.958 --> 00:23:14.792
<i>We can see each other again</i>

00:23:14.792 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>Let's meet up again some time</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:23.083
<i>Let's each set out in search of our own futures</i>

00:23:23.083 --> 00:23:27.625
<i>For the kindness you gave me for my heartache</i>

00:23:27.625 --> 00:23:32.042
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:23:33.208 --> 00:23:37.833
<i>These flower petals seem just as if</i>

00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:43.583
<i>They were blessing us as we depart on our journeys</i>

00:23:43.583 --> 00:23:47.833
<i>I won't forget your warmth</i>

00:23:47.833 --> 00:23:53.125
<i>That overwhelmed my loneliness</i>

00:23:53.125 --> 00:23:58.208
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:24:07.042 --> 00:24:07.958
"Next Episode"

00:24:09.125 --> 00:24:13.375
"Dark Arts Chapter Third Night Inhuman Powers"

00:24:13.375 --> 00:24:17.131
"Tokyo Majin"
"Dark Arts Chapter Third Night Inhuman Powers"
